<title>UK: IKB Deutsche Industriebnk sets 150 mln mark bond.</title>
<headline>IKB Deutsche Industriebnk sets 150 mln mark bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-02-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following REX-linked bond was announced by lead manager SGZ Bank.</p>
<p> BORROWER   IKB DEUTSCHE INDUSTRIEBANK AG</p>
<p> AMT    150 MLN DEM   COUPON   **4.70	MATURITY    19.MAR.07</p>
<p> TYPE   REX-LINKED    ISS PRICE  102.30    PAY DATE    19.MAR.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  2.50	LISTING    DUES	PAY FREQ    ANNUAL</p>
<p> NOTES    **FOR FIRST YEAR, THEN REX 10-YEAR INDEX TIMES 81 PCT</p>
<p> MGT/UND    1.0	 SELL CONC  1.5	 DENOMS (K)  1</p>
<p> GOV LAW    GERMAN</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
